      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 278,
      "end_line": 278,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000153",
      "kind": "fenced_code",
      "start_line": 279,
      "end_line": 288,
      "raw": "```qml\nimport LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.TextEditor {\n    filePath: \"/tmp/notes.html\"\n    chunkSize: 65536\n\n    onSyncFinished: console.log(\"Synchronized\", path)\n}\n```\n",
